<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="airsup-page">
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>
  <div class="container airsup-shell">
    <main class="airsup-main">
      <h1 class="airsup-title">Google login is not configured yet.</h1>
      <p class="airsup-sub">This page does not fake a login. Add a real Google OAuth client, then the Gmail button will sign people in.</p>
      <ol class="airsup-setup">
        <li>In Google Cloud, create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application).</li>
        <li>Add these authorized redirect URIs:
          <ul>
            <% redirectUris.forEach((uri) => { %>
              <li><code><%= uri %></code></li>
            <% }) %>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Set these environment variables, then restart:
          <ul>
            <li><code>AIRSUP_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID</code></li>
            <li><code>AIRSUP_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET</code></li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>On Vercel, add the same two variables for production.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="airsup-note">Details: <code>airsup/README.md</code></p>
      <a class="airsup-text-btn" href="/airsup">back</a>
    </main>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
